Originally forked from [luan/vimfiles](https://github.com/luan/vimfiles).

Key commands include:
- `brew install tree-sitter-cli`
- `git clone git@github.com:hnandiwada/nvim.git ~/.config/nvim`
- `pip3 install ruff`
 - `brew install fd`
- `npm i -g pyright` (double check the path in `coc-settings.json`)
- `cd ~/.config/coc/extensions && npm install coc-prettier`
- `:CocInstall coc-prettier`
- `:Lazy sync`
- `:TSUpdate`
- `brew install --cask font-jetbrains-mono-nerd-font`
